pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 50, 700, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>TRUST · 隐私架构</p>
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 78, 1120, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>隐私不是功能，是架构</p>
  - elementId: titleBar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 136, 44, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: t1card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 170, 352, 205]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$paperRaised"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: t1icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [104, 192, 26, 26]
    iconName: "fas:user-secret"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: t1title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [142, 194, 268, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 19
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>匿名即用</strong></p>
  - elementId: t1desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [104, 240, 304, 100]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p>无需注册。个人分析只保存在用户自己的浏览器，访客之间互不读取。</p>
